            "niveau": "easy",
            "reponse": "$\\dfrac{f(1+h) - f(1)}{h} = \\dfrac{h^2 - h}{h} = h - 1$<br>$\\lim_{h \\to 0} (h-1) = -1$<br>Donc $f'(1) = -1$."
          }
        ]
      },
